{
    "title": "EA SPORTS FC\u2122 Mobile Soccer",
    "description": "FIFA Mobile is now EA SPORTS FC\u2122 Mobile Soccer! The World's Game is ready for the 2024/2025 Season of Soccer/Football. \r\n\r\nPlay as any team from the Premier League or LALIGA EA SPORTS including Liverpool, Chelsea & Real Madrid in the all new Club Challenge PVP mode. Play as current stars like Jude Bellingham, Phil Foden, Cole Palmer, Virgil van Dijk, Son Heung-Min new prodigies like Endrick or legendary ICONs like Gianluigi Buffon & Gareth Bale. Train & build your dream Football Ultimate Team\u2122 to win trophies and own the pitch. FC Mobile has the biggest competitions, leagues, & players across the world with more than 18K fully licensed players, 690+ teams, & 30+ football / soccer leagues.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES \r\nScore goals with some of the world\u2019s best players as you level up a team of soccer superstars. \r\nJoin a league with your friends & compete in PvP soccerl games including 1v1 Head to Head, VS Attack & Manager Mode. \r\nStay up to date with the real football / soccer season in FC Football Centre, where you can play the latest Key Matches and earn the most celebrated players in today\u2019s game. \r\n\r\nCLUB CHALLENGE MODE\r\nCompete as any authentic English Premier League or LALIGA EA SPORTS Club in a real time competitive PVP multiplayer game.\r\nPlay as Liverpool, Chelsea, Manchester City or Real Madrid, Atl\u00e9tico de Madrid & many more.\r\nImmerse yourself in the authentic league broadcasting packages to relive real world matches. \r\n\r\nNEXT-LEVEL SOCCER GAMEPLAY\r\nElite Shooting System: Realistic shot system allows you to up your scoring game\r\nTrue Player Personality: Authentic player traits with impactful attributes & diverse animations\r\nDynamic Soccer Game Speed: Mobile-first & tactile game speed, dynamic gameplay experience\r\n\r\nSOCCER / FOOTBALL LEAGUES, LEGENDS & COMPETITIONS\r\nPremier League, LALIGA EA SPORTS, UEFA Champions League (UCL), MLS, Bundesliga, Ligue 1 McDonald\u2019s, Serie A Enilive & many more are playable throughout the season.\r\nPlay with soccer legends & ICONs: Gianluigi Buffon, Gareth Bale, Zinedine Zidane, David Beckham & Many more.\r\n\r\nIMMERSIVE NEXT-LEVEL SOCCER GAME\r\nDiscover authentic broadcast experiences for the English Premier League, LALIGA EA SPORTS and UEFA Champions League, coming soon. \r\nSwap between new dynamic cameras for amazing replays.\r\nExperience realistic stadium SFX & live on-field commentary.\r\nUnlock stadiums & weather modes for an authentic soccer experience.\r\n\r\nFIFA Mobile is now FC Mobile. Join the next generation of soccer legends with EA SPORTS FC and go anywhere for the club.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis app: Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s User Agreement and Privacy & Cookie Policy. Do Not Sell My Personal Information: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACYCA/US/en/PC/ Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Allows players (above the minimum age of digital consent in their country) to communicate via League chat; to disable for users under the age of majority with League chat access, use your device's parental controls. Includes in-game advertising. Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. The app uses Google Play Game Services. Log out of Google Play Game Services before installation if you don\u2019t want to share your game play with friends. This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items. FC Points not available in Belgium.\r\n\r\nUser Agreement: terms.ea.com\r\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com\r\nVisit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries.\r\nEA may retire online features after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.",
    "descriptionHTML": "FIFA Mobile is now EA SPORTS FC\u2122 Mobile Soccer! The World&#39;s Game is ready for the 2024/2025 Season of Soccer/Football. <br><br>Play as any team from the Premier League or LALIGA EA SPORTS including Liverpool, Chelsea &amp; Real Madrid in the all new Club Challenge PVP mode. Play as current stars like Jude Bellingham, Phil Foden, Cole Palmer, Virgil van Dijk, Son Heung-Min new prodigies like Endrick or legendary ICONs like Gianluigi Buffon &amp; Gareth Bale. Train &amp; build your dream Football Ultimate Team\u2122 to win trophies and own the pitch. FC Mobile has the biggest competitions, leagues, &amp; players across the world with more than 18K fully licensed players, 690+ teams, &amp; 30+ football / soccer leagues.<br><br>KEY FEATURES <br>Score goals with some of the world\u2019s best players as you level up a team of soccer superstars. <br>Join a league with your friends &amp; compete in PvP soccerl games including 1v1 Head to Head, VS Attack &amp; Manager Mode. <br>Stay up to date with the real football / soccer season in FC Football Centre, where you can play the latest Key Matches and earn the most celebrated players in today\u2019s game. <br><br>CLUB CHALLENGE MODE<br>Compete as any authentic English Premier League or LALIGA EA SPORTS Club in a real time competitive PVP multiplayer game.<br>Play as Liverpool, Chelsea, Manchester City or Real Madrid, Atl\u00e9tico de Madrid &amp; many more.<br>Immerse yourself in the authentic league broadcasting packages to relive real world matches. <br><br>NEXT-LEVEL SOCCER GAMEPLAY<br>Elite Shooting System: Realistic shot system allows you to up your scoring game<br>True Player Personality: Authentic player traits with impactful attributes &amp; diverse animations<br>Dynamic Soccer Game Speed: Mobile-first &amp; tactile game speed, dynamic gameplay experience<br><br>SOCCER / FOOTBALL LEAGUES, LEGENDS &amp; COMPETITIONS<br>Premier League, LALIGA EA SPORTS, UEFA Champions League (UCL), MLS, Bundesliga, Ligue 1 McDonald\u2019s, Serie A Enilive &amp; many more are playable throughout the season.<br>Play with soccer legends &amp; ICONs: Gianluigi Buffon, Gareth Bale, Zinedine Zidane, David Beckham &amp; Many more.<br><br>IMMERSIVE NEXT-LEVEL SOCCER GAME<br>Discover authentic broadcast experiences for the English Premier League, LALIGA EA SPORTS and UEFA Champions League, coming soon. <br>Swap between new dynamic cameras for amazing replays.<br>Experience realistic stadium SFX &amp; live on-field commentary.<br>Unlock stadiums &amp; weather modes for an authentic soccer experience.<br><br>FIFA Mobile is now FC Mobile. Join the next generation of soccer legends with EA SPORTS FC and go anywhere for the club.<br><br><br>This app: Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s User Agreement and Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy. Do Not Sell My Personal Information: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACYCA/US/en/PC/ Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Allows players (above the minimum age of digital consent in their country) to communicate via League chat; to disable for users under the age of majority with League chat access, use your device&#39;s parental controls. Includes in-game advertising. Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. The app uses Google Play Game Services. Log out of Google Play Game Services before installation if you don\u2019t want to share your game play with friends. This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items. FC Points not available in Belgium.<br><br>User Agreement: terms.ea.com<br>Privacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com<br>Visit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries.<br>EA may retire online features after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.",
